<title>USA: PP&amp;L buys stake in Empresas Emel.</title>
<headline>PP&amp;L buys stake in Empresas Emel.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PP&amp;L Resources Inc said on Wednesday that it has agreed to buy a 25.05 percent stake in Empresas Emel SA, a Chilean holding company with interests in several Chilean electricity distribution companies and a Bolivian utility.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be valued at approximately $120 million, PP&amp;L Resources said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close this summer, subject to a share purchase agreement, regulatory approvals and approval of Emel's shareholders, PP&amp;L said.</p>
</text>
